### Register a test user
POST http://localhost:4001/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "demo",
  "password": "choose-a-strong-password"
}

### Login to retrieve an access and refresh token
POST http://localhost:4001/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "demo",
  "password": "choose-a-strong-password"
}
